                <div id="curve-indicator" class="same-x-indicator"></div>
                <div id="intensity-tooltip"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<div id="principle-modal">
    <div class="modal-inner" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
        <button id="modal-close-button" aria-label="关闭">×</button>
        <h2 id="modal-title">杨氏双缝干涉原理</h2>
        <p>单色光通过两条平行狭缝后发生衍射，两束相干光在远处屏幕上叠加，形成明暗相间的干涉条纹。</p>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 420 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
